{"title": "Storms kill five in Mexico; Hurricane Simon approaches", "summary": "Tropical weather systems have caused five deaths and damage in Pacific coastal towns and resorts in Mexico. Hurricane Simon is moving slowly up the west-central coast, bringing wind and flooding rain. German nationals were among those airlifted to safety.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "मेक्सिको में तूफान से पांच की मौत; हरिकेन सिमोन पहुंचा", "summary_hi": "मेक्सिको के प्रशांत तटीय कस्बों और रिसॉर्ट्स में उष्णकटिबंधीय मौसम प्रणालियों के कारण पांच लोगों की मौत हो गई और नुकसान हुआ है। हरिकेन सिमोन पश्चिम-मध्य तट पर धीरे-धीरे आगे बढ़ रहा है, जिससे हवाएं और बाढ़ का पानी आ रहा है। जर्मन नागरिक भी सुरक्षित निकाले गए लोगों में शामिल थे।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"center": ["Emphasized the deaths and damage caused by tropical weather systems in Pacific coastal towns and resorts.", "Highlighted that German nationals were among those airlifted to safety."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["प्रशांत तटीय कस्बों और रिसॉर्ट्स में उष्णकटिबंधीय मौसम प्रणालियों से हुई मौतों और नुकसान पर जोर दिया।", "इस बात पर प्रकाश डाला कि जर्मन नागरिक सुरक्षित निकाले गए लोगों में शामिल थे।"]}, "topic": "Environment", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "", "sources": [{"source": "Reuters", "owner": "Reuters", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Hurricane Simon crawls along Mexico's Pacific coast, bringing floods and evacuations"}, {"source": "CBS News", "owner": "CBS News", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.cbsnews.com/news/hurricane-simon-still-hitting-western-mexico-after-tropical-systems-kill-5", "headline": "Hurricane Simon hits western Mexico after storms kill 5"}, {"source": "CBS News", "owner": "CBS News", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPQTltZFUyRm5WWUxVNUphSUZvY0hXWC1fTTlwbW8zLWs5eEN6QXA4UWNBSXF6RlNfX25TREFMSFljMFloaURlc2lPeHBRakVOUjhldWtpYllkZFpN